answer	Property: one contiguous, sorted array of pairs, which gives cache-friendly binary search and linear iteration. Same property: inserts and erases shift every element after the slot, and growth reallocates and moves everything (O(N) bytes). Build check: compile with -DNDEBUG (or BOOST_DISABLE_ASSERTS), otherwise Boost's BOOST_ASSERT checks run inside the search loop.
confidence	unsure
grade	h
